{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:10 2026-06-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:10 2026-06-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:10 2026-06-29 HKT</p><p>今(29日)早上9時42分，何文田自由道4號一地盤，一部吊起鐵通的吊臂車突翻側，鐵通墮下壓著一名男工人，他當場昏迷不醒，救護員接報到場，經檢驗後證實男工當場死亡，另有一名男工人受傷。</p><img alt=\"現場為何文田自由道4號一地盤。江雪晴攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9a30ca70027ab83df89ed7a52646ebc/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_07_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/32ebcbbe16f6ca3c7b82ddae6457325b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"吊臂車翻側。江雪晴攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e32b47c43b36be09634c05d7f008a55c/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_07.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/00e19688cdc6f8ec9d32550e657fc4b9/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_06.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1b5b8eb65b035cfc94bdc8a349639fc5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_10_29_05.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T02:42:39.277756+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}